{
 "about": "R-01's last kilometre (tools/terrain/serchu_road.py; M2 sprint 12, step 1): from the Serchu Zampa's south abutment down the river's south bank to SER-20, the cliff gallery's east end; `lanes` road lanes for tools/terrain/pads.py (its bed cut into the slope, walled by tools/town/walls.py); `path` the way walked [x, y, z] from the Zampa to the gallery for the game and the caravan (past the mani wall by its south side), `path_up` the way walked from the gallery up to the Zampa (by its north side), `line` the road's own middle; `washers` the gold washers' places at the water's edge [x, y, z, facing] (step 6); `zampa` the bridge over the Serchu (its middle, span, abutments, the water under it, `facing` the bearing from its south end to its north); `north_path` R-01 on the north bank from the Zampa's north face through its gateway chorten and upstream (step 2); `places` where world/town.gd stands the Zampa SER-04, its gateway chorten (SER-04C) and the durtro path's cairn SER-14, `pads` the porters' rest SER-19 (pads.py cuts it at the road's level); `things` the gold washings' huts and troughs (SER-12) on the bank; `mani_wall` the road mani wall SER-15's line down the middle of the road widened round it (tools/town/mani.py sets its segments); `paths` the durtro path up from the cairn and the path down to the washings, painted trodden by tools/terrain/control.py (step 3). Regenerated with the terrain.",
